        "cooked": "<p>“We have to justify this!” Oh, hey, my previous incarnation’s ears are burning …</p>\n<p>“The first random people are Setback and…” Well that’s your joke right there.  Doesn’t get much more random than that.</p>\n<p>I’ve definitely seen this thread before; I’m still uncertain whether I could have heard the episode.  This was only a month after my house burned, so I would have been in my new apartment, on furlough from work; I would have had time to listen, but did I?  If so, is this the actual last episode I heard before RIP GTG?  Or do I have another surprise coming?  I do feel like the Rolodex of possible villains behind this plot feels familiar.</p>\n<p>Paytron is the incarnation of Omnitron that just assimilates your bank account.</p>",
